 "notes": [
  {
   "book": 6,
   "row": 76,
   "sec": 3,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **CPCB categories by pollution:** **Red** is the most polluting, then **Orange** and **Green**; **White** is the least polluting (practically non-polluting); **Blue** is for essential environmental services such as waste treatment."
  },
  {
   "book": 6,
   "row": 76,
   "sec": 7,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **Pichavaram:** a mangrove forest in **Tamil Nadu** (Cuddalore district, near Chidambaram)."
  },
  {
   "book": 6,
   "row": 76,
   "sec": 8,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **CWC glacial lake monitoring:** the **Central Water Commission** monitors **2,843 glacial lakes and water bodies** of the Himalayan region by satellite; its 2011-2025 study found many lakes expanding."
  },
  {
   "book": 6,
   "row": 76,
   "sec": 9,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **Kandla e-methanol plant:** a joint project of **Deendayal Port Authority** and **Assam Petro-Chemicals Ltd (APCL)**; capacity **150 tonnes per day**; about **₹2,300 crore**."
  }
 ],
